 "kf": {
  "_doc": "verb_swap MEASURED motion (motion1.mp4, 30 fps, frame 1 = t 0). Design-free: times in s relative to the beat named in 'rel', travel in em of the line's font size, easings = fitted cubic-bezier [x1,y1,x2,y2] (max error in brackets). Words POP (opacity 0->1 in one frame, no blur, no scale); motion is horizontal only.",
