  "swap": {
   "_doc": "verb i-1 -> verb i: every word's x interpolates from the line laid out (centred) with verb i-1 to the line laid out with verb i; the verb is drawn centred in its interpolated slot. Motion starts lead_s BEFORE the beat; the verb TEXT and colour switch hard ON the beat (no roll, no fade, no blur). The line therefore re-centres with the width change. Default = one bezier fitted to both reference swaps (per-swap timing) [max err 0.056 progress]; measured[i-1] is used for swap i when present.",
